Dashboard protocol handling is derived from the contract and implementation of
Hermes Mobile (https://github.com/Hy4ri/hermes-mobile), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Original attribution is retained in derived source.
The Apache-2.0 license is included in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Tool envelope/name resolution and completed-result status handling follow Hermes Mobile's
ToolResultParser and ToolStatusResolver contracts.
Prompt admission/cancellation receipts, explicit approval replies and canonical/legacy clarify
reply shapes follow Hermes Mobile's WebSocket contracts; no Hermes Mobile UI was copied.
Latest-descendant response handling and stored/runtime session identity follow Hermes Mobile's
SessionOpsResponses and ActiveSessionHolder contracts. Session resume parameters/runtime result
handling follow its SessionPrompt contract and ChatViewModel resume flow; no reference UI was copied.
Audio transcription follows its AudioTranscription data_url/mime_type request and transcript response.

Light SDK and its dependencies retain their respective licenses.
BrightHermes patterns are reused with the owner's permission.
DictationTake and WheelTalk are ported from the owner's BrightHermes source with permission;
WheelTalk's private wheel-bus interface is adapted to SDK device keys.
